    "question": "how do I get testnet tokens from the faucet?",
    "found": true,
    "answer": "Add the **Pharos Atlantic Testnet** to your wallet, then request testnet PHRS from the Pharos faucet using your wallet address. The network uses RPC `https://atlantic.dplabs-internal.com`, chain ID `688689`, and token symbol `PHRS`.\n\nThe docs don’t provide the faucet URL or claim steps. See [Atlantic Testnet](/getting-started/network/atlantic-testnet) and [Piggy Bank Tutorial](/tooling-and-infrastructure/pharos-skill-engine-guide/piggybank-skill-guide).",
